	(text_box "Notes on DS3231:\nInternal pullup is enough for SDA/SCL Lines since they can be set high from esp during active alarm setting.\nBut for INT/SQW line, it will need pullup because it operates during deep sleep, and ds3231 can't set it high (Open drain).\nWhen powering the ds3231 for the first time, VCC should be powered. Once the battery powered wakeup register is enabled, the connection can be removed.\nThe 0 Ohm resistor is there just to play around."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.59 125.73 0)
		(size 60.96 24.13)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
